5%8A%A8%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%B4%E4%BD%93%E8%80%8C%E8%A8%80%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8E%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1632984868449\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/18/77124895/d8e889d90ebf4e330617e726d06599d8_2318884096885123799.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>真红骑士·月蚀</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">一代真红专属武器，对循环、攻速、伤害全方位提升</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/18/77124895/dfef0132b3af1dc2f6791065a20e99b8_5623485761224872184.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>血色玫瑰</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">开大后可以吃满所有加成，增加能量获取速度能更快开启大招</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/77124895/b172d96850920b5f7edc06929fd97590_8673648825840916387.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">曾经真红骑士·月蚀的毕业武器，现在则更多的是装备个血色玫瑰使用，这把武器被动增加的攻速和加快sp回复的效果极为适合血色玫瑰，而血色玫瑰开启大招后进入的爆发状态也可快速启动武器的另一个被动效果，整体而言对于玫瑰来说是最佳的武器选择。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/77124895/b172d96850920b5f7edc06929fd97590_8673648825840916387.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
